 style="color:#808080;line-height:21px;vertical-align:baseline;">Note: MD represents the vertical type, and TD represents the horizontal type.</span></span></span> </h3> <h3 style=''text-align:left;color:red;text-indent:0px;font-family:"font-style:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;''> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma;"><span style="line-height:21px;vertical-align:baseline;">The above data are gotten from the test data and it’s only for your reference.We suggest you’d better to test it by yourself before using. as the clients'' use conditions is beyond our control.</span></span></span> </h3> <h3 style=''text-align:left;color:red;text-indent:0px;font-family:"font-style:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;''> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma;"><span style="line-height:27px;vertical-align:baseline;">Product Usage:</span></span></span> </h3> <h3 style=''text-align:left;color:red;text-indent:0px;font-family:"font-style:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;''> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma;"><span style="line-height:21px;vertical-align:baseline;">The products are applicable to the printing plate-making, label, tape, carton window film, gift cover light composite, hot transfer and paste, glitter powder sequin, document/photo protection, coating compound, etc.</span></span></span> </h3>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (71, 265, 'Polyester based film clear transparent for Thermal Lamination Film coated', '../upload/image/20180923/20180923113235_59246.jpg', '<p></p><table bgcolor="#ffffff" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="ke-zeroborder" style="text-align:left;color:#59595B;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td height="25" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <h2> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Polyester based film clear transparent for Thermal Lamination Film coated</span> </h2> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">PROFILE</span></b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">: It is polyester based, both sides corona treated, uniformly extrusion coated with adhesive which enables lamination by heat and pressure with paper products. </span></span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">FEATURES :</span></b></span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">1) Fibre-tear bond strength with paper </span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> 2) Excellent optical properties.</span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> 3) Excellent resistance to elongation &amp; tear. </span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> 4) Offer increased productivity with simple operation.</span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">APPLICATIONS : </span></b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Thermal lamination with all kinds of printed &amp; unprinted paper and paper boards like maps, book covers, posters, magazines, boxes, brochures etc.</span></span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><b>TYPICAL PROPERTIES:</b></span></p> <table border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"> <tbody> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="216"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">PROPERTY</span></b><b></b></span></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="150"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">UNIT</span></b><b></b></span></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="126"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">ASTM/ TEST #</span></b><b></b></span></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="108"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">30 PCT-2</span></b><b></b></span></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">(PDL)</span></b><b></b></span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="216"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">PHYSICAL DATA</span></b></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Average Thickness</span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Average GSM</span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Yield</span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Wettability (min)</span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Coefficient of friction (F-F)</span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">OPTICAL DATA</span></b></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Gloss at 45</span><sup><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">0</span></sup><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">(min)</span></span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Lamination temp.</span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="150"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> <p align="